{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-12_end","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-12","title":"猩红烟火","storyCode":"13-14","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-12_end.txt","sourceHash":"94933527dbcc8769b9fef9736848dd5f6e9b9051c7d0a15744311f8f7bb59078","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g7_towngreenhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你昨晚没有把东西送到我的营帐......玛格达尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也没有离开布伦特伍德镇，可悲的选择。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不离开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是我的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是有新的订单吗？我可以连昨天的花一并送过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你今后不用再为那些订单操心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是来向你告别的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我即将前往食腐者之王阁下的军团中......作战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见。如果这是你想听到的问候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你太单纯，单纯到近乎愚蠢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直试图保护一些东西，但是它们却总是自取灭亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我一开始就错了，玛格达尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听不懂你在说什么，“锹子”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾无比羡慕你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚过去是高贵而又强大的国家，你们理所应当地占据了太多好东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们靠着发达的冶金学和蒸汽骑士征服了另一个帝国，靠着迷人的艺术和丰富的学术吸引了全泰拉的天才......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而如今，你们停下了向外征服的脚步。你们的统治者，流连于酒宴上的红酒杯，吹嘘着胸前勋章的虚名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荣光被亲自掐灭，被取代的命运也早已注定——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？这个挂钟你还留着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间过得真快，镇上的人应该都出发去工地了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们的死亡无法避免，玛格达尔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大君很不耐烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以仪式被要求提前了，而你们在那个菲林的带领下，确实超额完成了任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的人都会是开启仪式的钥匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，也包括你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......刚刚在萨卡兹的军营里，威尔被那些魔族佬留下了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾达......你看到了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g7_towngreenhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我得去找芙蕾达！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放开我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能离开这间温室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再等等吧，玛格达尔，我会陪着你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等着我们最后的告别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......镇上的人从来没有违背过你们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾达带着全镇的人满足了你们的所有要求！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下决定了这场战争，你们的公爵响应了这场战争。这个结果与我们，或是你们都无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只需要服从命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那让我去警告工地上的人！就像以前一样，你当作什么都不知道，求你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我为殿下效命，我不会允许你破坏仪式......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......除非你能越过我，玛格达尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能做到吗，“园丁”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g6_townbuildingsite"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛格达尔，你急匆匆的要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你衣服上的血......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没事——修剪枝杈时不小心剪破了手指......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汉克，芙蕾达在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾达？她早上一个人从军营那边回来之后，就去找那些萨卡兹长官了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她看上去失魂落魄的，看见谁都说对不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是发生什么事了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......快让大家赶紧远离这个地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越远越好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们今天怎么一个比一个奇怪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来不及解释了，我得去通知其他人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我们马上就要建完了呀？再说，要是我们旷工，被那些长官抓住怎么办？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烟花？哪来的烟花？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁把那堵墙炸开了？那是......芙蕾达？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"发生什么事了？地震了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快......快逃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在流血......该死，不要过来！那些恶心的怪物正从你身上掉下来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹到底想干嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汉克，汉克！你不能闭上眼睛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......也感觉好累......好困......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"玛格达尔！坚持住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"队长，我抓住她了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有人注意！抓稳滑索，不要接触地面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧救人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g6_townbuildingsite"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛格达尔小姐，现在还不能睡哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛小姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这家伙可真沉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏迷的市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特先生......自救军......怎么会？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们看到镇里大白天放烟花就猜到出事了！我们昨天打开的缺口被封上了，但你们的那门礼炮炸出了新的路线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓紧洛洛的手，玛格达尔！我们的战斗部队不足，只能先带着大家尽快撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔哦！费斯特，你改良后的滑索速度好像更快了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，芙蕾达镇长在哪？我们没找到她的位置。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......芙蕾达她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，我的滑索怎么开始抖起来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g6_townbuildingsite"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"那个懦弱的驻军指挥官呢，他又藏到哪里去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......无所谓，我来接手这里的指挥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感觉到，我的血......在沸腾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"不用通知厄尔苏拉少校的部队，我们自己就能解决这些可笑的维多利亚人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"杀死他们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g6_townbuildingsite"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座小镇里的驻军正在组织反攻，他们的气势......比我们之前遭遇过的萨卡兹都要高涨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的老维斯还有多少炸药？他来得及支援我们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"估计不太行，除去布设滑索的成员，我们能参与战斗的人员本来就不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把那几台爬行者都开起来，我们需要强行突围！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，小心！你们的滑索！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"好疼——\n没事吧，玛格达尔小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还能走吗？啧，这些恶心的玩意——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"这是大君的赐福，这是鲜血的王庭为我们保留的仁慈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我们体内......纯净的血脉正在苏醒，别和这些维多利亚人浪费时间了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛小姐，你先走吧——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛格达尔小姐，做好战斗准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没那么难，我们以前......也都没经历过战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深呼吸就好，下定决心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火炮？我们的炸药不是用完了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，洛洛，玛格达尔小姐，趁现在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们接收到了几位老熟人的联络，他们带来了一支支援部队！他们甚至有个识别码——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“典范军”！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"这里是战车火力手号角，所有人注意，避开我的轰炸区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"榴弹填装完毕，第二轮发射！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"突破口打开了，掩护自救军和市民！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"号角，继续压制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那些法阵......得想办法让这些巫术玩意先停下来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":true,"text":"维娜，别再让我开车了，我要加入地面部队！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":true,"text":"汉娜，看你前面的路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":true,"text":"好吧好吧——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"让战车尽量抵近法阵的核心，我来搞定那东西！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":true,"text":"维娜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"你们还有其他的任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"所有人员按照常规部署整队。摩根，汉娜，你们和号角小姐按原计划指挥战车开路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"希勒少尉、达格达、戴菲恩，麻烦你们指挥地面编队组织防线，拦住那些血魔大君的小虫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":true,"text":"放心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":true,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":true,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"Misery先生，敌方部队的指挥官交给你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":true,"text":"你大胆执行你的计划即可。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"费斯特，好久不见，寒暄放在之后。我需要自救军帮我布置滑索到法阵上方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"事不宜迟，先把那个奇怪的法阵给解决了再说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我的背后就交给各位了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欢呼的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看啊！我们维多利亚战车的炮火轻而易举就可以把那些东西轰成碎末！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欢呼的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们早就说过，那些魔族佬在我们维多利亚的军队面前不堪一击！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欢呼的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"碾碎他们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，镇上布置的源石结晶太多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镇长办公室，小广场，图书馆......我们夜以继日修建那些东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能来得及——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......结束了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g6_townbuildingsite"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......法阵已经破损，血魔的子裔在失控，抓住机会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"步兵集团停止前进，护送身边的市民退出法阵范围。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战车分队跟我继续推进，摧毁镇子里剩余的源石结晶，搜救市民！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
